title: Neorevisionist leaders resign
new-page: true
subtitle: Neorevisionist disagreements with our policies have grown too severe.
tags: event
view-if: not neorev_split and ((spd_centrist and neorevisionist_dissent >= 70) or (not spd_centrist and neorevisionist_dissent >= 60))
on-arrival: {!
Q.neorevisionist_strength *= 0.3;
Q.workers_spd -= 10;
Q.workers_other += 5;
Q.neorev_split = 1;
dropAdvisors("neo", ["mierendorff"], 2);
!}
go-to: srpd_formed

= Neorevisionist leaders resign

Our policy choices have greatly offended the Neorevisionist faction. Many of our most fierce leaders have resigned. Most of them went to form the **Social Republican Party of Germany**, our republican counterpart.